  "title": "Secure Agent Factory Pipelines with Microsoft Entra ID",
  "date": "2026-10-13T08:17:37",
  "dateGmt": "2026-10-13T08:17:37",
  "modified": "2026-10-13T08:18:30",
  "modifiedGmt": "2026-10-13T08:18:30",
  "link": "https://ca-copilotexperiencelab-hwsaws.jollyhill-9f56f37c.centralindia.azurecontainerapps.io/2026/10/13/secure-agent-factory-pipelines-with-microsoft-entra-id/",
  "author": "Sagar Rangi",
  "contentRaw": "<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This guide explains how to control Agent Factory pipeline access using Microsoft Entra security groups and Dataverse group teams. It covers assigning separate administrator and operator roles and sharing the pipeline with operators using Read-only access.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Scope:</strong> This article configures pipeline access only. PROD approval gates and delegated deployment are not configured here; they are a later step.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Create the Microsoft Entra Security Groups</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Platform administrators to <code>SG-AF-Pipeline-Admins</code></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Approved release operators to <code>SG-AF-Pipeline-Operators</code></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<figure class=\"runbook-screenshot pipeline-security-screenshot\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;max-width:760px;margin:1.5rem auto\"><a href=\"https://ca-copilotexperiencelab-hwsaws.jollyhill-9f56f37c.centralindia.azurecontainerapps.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/security-group.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Open full-size screenshot\"><img src=\"https://ca-copilotexperiencelab-hwsaws.jollyhill-9f56f37c.centralindia.azurecontainerapps.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/security-group.webp\" alt=\"Microsoft Entra security groups for pipeline administrators and operators.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto\"></a><figcaption>Microsoft Entra security groups for pipeline administrators and operators.</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Create Dataverse Group Teams in the Pipeline Host</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":1} -->\n<ol start=\"1\" class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>In the Power Platform pipeline-host environment, create Dataverse group teams backed by the Entra groups. Open <strong>Manage → Environments → AF-PILOT-HOST → Settings → Users + permissions → Teams</strong>.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<figure class=\"runbook-screenshot pipeline-security-screenshot\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;max-width:760px;margin:1.5rem auto\"><a href=\"https://ca-copilotexperiencelab-hwsaws.jollyhill-9f56f37c.centralindia.azurecontainerapps.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/pipeline-admins-00.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Open full-size screenshot\"><img src=\"https://ca-copilotexperiencelab-hwsaws.jollyhill-9f56f37c.centralindia.azurecontainerapps.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/pipeline-admins-00.webp\" alt=\"Open AF-PILOT-HOST settings, then Users + permissions &gt; Teams.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto\"></a><figcaption>Open AF-PILOT-HOST settings, then Users + permissions &gt; Teams.</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<figure class=\"runbook-screenshot pipeline-security-screenshot\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;max-width:760px;margin:1.5rem auto\"><a href=\"https://ca-copilotexperiencelab-hwsaws.jollyhill-9f56f37c.centralindia.azurecontainerapps.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/pipeline-admins-01.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Open full-size screenshot\"><img src=\"https://ca-copilotexperiencelab-hwsaws.jollyhill-9f56f37c.centralindia.azurecontainerapps.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/pipeline-admins-01.webp\" alt=\"Select Create team in the pipeline host environment.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto\"></a><figcaption>Select Create team in the pipeline host environment.</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":2} -->\n<ol start=\"2\" class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Selected <strong>Create team</strong> and configured the administrator team:<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} -->\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Team name: <code>SG-AF-Pipeline-Admins</code></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Business unit: <code>orge4897472</code></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Administrator: <code>Prashant Rangi</code></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Team type: <strong>Microsoft Entra ID Security Group</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Entra group Object ID: <code>c9150897-12c9-44ec-90ea-6340a7dd6ad7</code></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Membership type: <strong>Members</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list --></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<figure class=\"runbook-screenshot pipeline-security-screenshot\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;max-width:760px;margin:1.5rem auto\"><a href=\"https://ca-copilotexperiencelab-hwsaws.jollyhill-9f56f37c.centralindia.azurecontainerapps.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/create-team-ppac.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Open full-size screenshot\"><img src=\"https://ca-copilotexperiencelab-hwsaws.jollyhill-9f56f37c.centralindia.azurecontainerapps.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/create-team-ppac.webp\" alt=\"Administrator group team linked to SG-AF-Pipeline-Admins, with membership type Members.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto\"></a><figcaption>Administrator group team linked to SG-AF-Pipeline-Admins, with membership type Members.</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Repeat <strong>Create team</strong> for <code>SG-AF-Pipeline-Operators</code>, select its matching Microsoft Entra security group, and keep <strong>Membership type: Members</strong>. Use the business unit and administrator appropriate to your environment.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<figure class=\"runbook-screenshot pipeline-security-screenshot\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;max-width:760px;margin:1.5rem auto\"><a href=\"https://ca-copilotexperiencelab-hwsaws.jollyhill-9f56f37c.centralindia.azurecontainerapps.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/new-team-creation.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Open full-size screenshot\"><img src=\"https://ca-copilotexperiencelab-hwsaws.jollyhill-9f56f37c.centralindia.azurecontainerapps.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/new-team-creation.webp\" alt=\"Operator group team linked to SG-AF-Pipeline-Operators, with membership type Members.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto\"></a><figcaption>Operator group team linked to SG-AF-Pipeline-Operators, with membership type Members.</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Assign Administrator and Operator Roles</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":3} -->\n<ol start=\"3\" class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Assign the pipeline security roles:<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Admins → <strong>Deployment Pipeline Administrator</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Operators → <strong>Deployment Pipeline User</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list --></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<figure class=\"runbook-screenshot pipeline-security-screenshot\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;max-width:760px;margin:1.5rem auto\"><a href=\"https://ca-copilotexperiencelab-hwsaws.jollyhill-9f56f37c.centralindia.azurecontainerapps.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/role-assignment-confirmation.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Open full-size screenshot\"><img src=\"https://ca-copilotexperiencelab-hwsaws.jollyhill-9f56f37c.centralindia.azurecontainerapps.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/role-assignment-confirmation.webp\" alt=\"Deployment Pipeline User selected for the operator team before saving.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto\"></a><figcaption>Deployment Pipeline User selected for the operator team before saving.</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<figure class=\"runbook-screenshot pipeline-security-screenshot\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;max-width:760px;margin:1.5rem auto\"><a href=\"https://ca-copilotexperiencelab-hwsaws.jollyhill-9f56f37c.centralindia.azurecontainerapps.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/teams-created-confirmation.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Open full-size screenshot\"><img src=\"https://ca-copilotexperiencelab-hwsaws.jollyhill-9f56f37c.centralindia.azurecontainerapps.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/teams-created-confirmation.webp\" alt=\"Confirmation that the operator team security roles were updated successfully.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto\"></a><figcaption>Confirmation that the operator team security roles were updated successfully.</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Share the Pipeline with Read-Only Access</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>After assigning the <strong>Deployment Pipeline User</strong> role, the pipeline record must be shared with the operator team.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":1} -->\n<ol start=\"1\" class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Open the <strong>Deployment Pipeline Configuration</strong> app in the pipeline host environment.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Select <strong>Pipelines</strong> and open <code>AF-PILOT-Standard-Release</code>.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Select <strong>Share → Manage access</strong>.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<figure class=\"runbook-screenshot pipeline-security-screenshot\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;max-width:760px;margin:1.5rem auto\"><a href=\"https://ca-copilotexperiencelab-hwsaws.jollyhill-9f56f37c.centralindia.azurecontainerapps.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/share-access-01.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Open full-size screenshot\"><img src=\"https://ca-copilotexperiencelab-hwsaws.jollyhill-9f56f37c.centralindia.azurecontainerapps.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/share-access-01.webp\" alt=\"Open AF-PILOT-Standard-Release and select Share &gt; Manage access.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto\"></a><figcaption>Open AF-PILOT-Standard-Release and select Share &gt; Manage access.</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":4} -->\n<ol start=\"4\" class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>In <strong>Add user/team</strong>, open the advanced lookup.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<figure class=\"runbook-screenshot pipeline-security-screenshot\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;max-width:760px;margin:1.5rem auto\"><a href=\"https://ca-copilotexperiencelab-hwsaws.jollyhill-9f56f37c.centralindia.azurecontainerapps.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/share-access-02.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Open full-size screenshot\"><img src=\"https://ca-copilotexperiencelab-hwsaws.jollyhill-9f56f37c.centralindia.azurecontainerapps.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/share-access-02.webp\" alt=\"Open the advanced lookup from Add user/team.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto\"></a><figcaption>Open the advanced lookup from Add user/team.</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":5} -->\n<ol start=\"5\" class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Select <strong>Teams → All Security Group Teams</strong>.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Search for and select <code>SG-AF-Pipeline-Operators</code>.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<figure class=\"runbook-screenshot pipeline-security-screenshot\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;max-width:760px;margin:1.5rem auto\"><a href=\"https://ca-copilotexperiencelab-hwsaws.jollyhill-9f56f37c.centralindia.azurecontainerapps.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/share-access-03.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Open full-size screenshot\"><img src=\"https://ca-copilotexperiencelab-hwsaws.jollyhill-9f56f37c.centralindia.azurecontainerapps.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/share-access-03.webp\" alt=\"Choose Teams &gt; All Security Group Teams, select SG-AF-Pipeline-Operators, and select Done.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto\"></a><figcaption>Choose Teams &gt; All Security Group Teams, select SG-AF-Pipeline-Operators, and select Done.</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":7} -->\n<ol start=\"7\" class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Grant <strong>Read</strong> permission only.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Leave Write, Delete, Append, Append To, Assign and Share disabled.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Select <strong>Share</strong> to apply the permission.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<figure class=\"runbook-screenshot pipeline-security-screenshot\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;max-width:760px;margin:1.5rem auto\"><a href=\"https://ca-copilotexperiencelab-hwsaws.jollyhill-9f56f37c.centralindia.azurecontainerapps.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/share-access-04.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Open full-size screenshot\"><img src=\"https://ca-copilotexperiencelab-hwsaws.jollyhill-9f56f37c.centralindia.azurecontainerapps.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/share-access-04.webp\" alt=\"Grant SG-AF-Pipeline-Operators Read only, then select Share.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto\"></a><figcaption>Grant SG-AF-Pipeline-Operators Read only, then select Share.</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Read access allows operators to discover and run the shared pipeline without giving them permission to modify its configuration.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Understand Administrator Access</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The <code>SG-AF-Pipeline-Admins</code> team does not need each pipeline record to be shared individually.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What This Establishes for an Agent Factory</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Centralized pipeline access through Microsoft Entra groups</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Easier onboarding and removal of team members</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Reduced administrative access to the pipeline host</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>A scalable foundation for production deployment governance</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Pipeline roles do not automatically grant access to DEV, TEST, or PROD. Environment access and Dataverse security roles must still be managed separately.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Why These Controls Matter</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Agents are deployed as solution components, so an uncontrolled pipeline can introduce unreviewed agent instructions, actions, connectors, knowledge sources, or configuration changes into production.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When group memberships and effective permissions are validated, these controls help ensure that:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Only approved administrators can change deployment routes.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Only authorized operators can initiate deployments.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Access can be reviewed and audited centrally.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Group-derived access can be removed through Entra membership changes; direct roles, other teams, and separate sharing grants must also be reviewed.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Group-based administration reduces reliance on one person for pipeline access management.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>These configurations establish a group-based access-control foundation for the Agent Factory pipeline. Administrators manage pipeline configuration, while operators receive access to run the shared pipeline without modifying it. This makes access management more repeatable as additional agent projects and release operators are onboarded.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Before treating the setup as validated, test administrator and operator access, review overlapping memberships and direct permissions, and confirm the required source and target environment privileges. PROD approval gating and delegated deployment remain separate configuration steps.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A separately configured and tested PROD approval gate can add independent release review. Delegated deployment determines the deployment identity; it does not by itself establish independent review.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->",
  "contentRendered": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">This guide explains how to control Agent Factory pipeline access using Microsoft Entra security groups and Dataverse group teams. It covers assigning separate administrator and operator roles and sharing the pipeline with operators using Read-only access.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Scope:</strong> This article configures pipeline access only. PROD approval gates and delegated deployment are not configured here; they are a later step.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Create the Microsoft Entra Security Groups</h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Platform administrators to <code>SG-AF-Pipeline-Admins</code></li>\n\n\n\n<li>Approved release operators to <code>SG-AF-Pipeline-Operators</code></li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"runbook-screenshot pipeline-security-screenshot\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;max-width:760px;margin:1.5rem auto\"><a href=\"https://ca-copilotexperiencelab-hwsaws.jollyhill-9f56f37c.centralindia.azurecontainerapps.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/security-group.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Open full-size screenshot\"><img src=\"https://ca-copilotexperiencelab-hwsaws.jollyhill-9f56f37c.centralindia.azurecontainerapps.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/security-group.webp\" alt=\"Microsoft Entra security groups for pipeline administrators and operators.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto\"></a><figcaption>Microsoft Entra security groups for pipeline administrators and operators.</figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Create Dataverse Group Teams in the Pipeline Host</h2>\n\n\n\n<ol start=\"1\" class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>In the Power Platform pipeline-host environment, create Dataverse group teams backed by the Entra groups. Open <strong>Manage → Environments → AF-PILOT-HOST → Settings → Users + permissions → Teams</strong>.</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"runbook-screenshot pipeline-security-screenshot\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;max-width:760px;margin:1.5rem auto\"><a href=\"https://ca-copilotexperiencelab-hwsaws.jollyhill-9f56f37c.centralindia.azurecontainerapps.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/pipeline-admins-00.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Open full-size screenshot\"><img src=\"https://ca-copilotexperiencelab-hwsaws.jollyhill-9f56f37c.centralindia.azurecontainerapps.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/pipeline-admins-00.webp\" alt=\"Open AF-PILOT-HOST settings, then Users + permissions &gt; Teams.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto\"></a><figcaption>Open AF-PILOT-HOST settings, then Users + permissions &gt; Teams.</figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"runbook-screenshot pipeline-security-screenshot\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;max-width:760px;margin:1.5rem auto\"><a href=\"https://ca-copilotexperiencelab-hwsaws.jollyhill-9f56f37c.centralindia.azurecontainerapps.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/pipeline-admins-01.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Open full-size screenshot\"><img src=\"https://ca-copilotexperiencelab-hwsaws.jollyhill-9f56f37c.centralindia.azurecontainerapps.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/pipeline-admins-01.webp\" alt=\"Select Create team in the pipeline host environment.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto\"></a><figcaption>Select Create team in the pipeline host environment.</figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<ol start=\"2\" class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Selected <strong>Create team</strong> and configured the administrator team:\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Team name: <code>SG-AF-Pipeline-Admins</code></li>\n\n\n\n<li>Business unit: <code>orge4897472</code></li>\n\n\n\n<li>Administrator: <code>Prashant Rangi</code></li>\n\n\n\n<li>Team type: <strong>Microsoft Entra ID Security Group</strong></li>\n\n\n\n<li>Entra group Object ID: <code>c9150897-12c9-44ec-90ea-6340a7dd6ad7</code></li>\n\n\n\n<li>Membership type: <strong>Members</strong></li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"runbook-screenshot pipeline-security-screenshot\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;max-width:760px;margin:1.5rem auto\"><a href=\"https://ca-copilotexperiencelab-hwsaws.jollyhill-9f56f37c.centralindia.azurecontainerapps.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/create-team-ppac.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Open full-size screenshot\"><img src=\"https://ca-copilotexperiencelab-hwsaws.jollyhill-9f56f37c.centralindia.azurecontainerapps.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/create-team-ppac.webp\" alt=\"Administrator group team linked to SG-AF-Pipeline-Admins, with membership type Members.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto\"></a><figcaption>Administrator group team linked to SG-AF-Pipeline-Admins, with membership type Members.</figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Repeat <strong>Create team</strong> for <code>SG-AF-Pipeline-Operators</code>, select its matching Microsoft Entra security group, and keep <strong>Membership type: Members</strong>. Use the business unit and administrator appropriate to your environment.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"runbook-screenshot pipeline-security-screenshot\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;max-width:760px;margin:1.5rem auto\"><a href=\"https://ca-copilotexperiencelab-hwsaws.jollyhill-9f56f37c.centralindia.azurecontainerapps.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/new-team-creation.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Open full-size screenshot\"><img src=\"https://ca-copilotexperiencelab-hwsaws.jollyhill-9f56f37c.centralindia.azurecontainerapps.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/new-team-creation.webp\" alt=\"Operator group team linked to SG-AF-Pipeline-Operators, with membership type Members.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto\"></a><figcaption>Operator group team linked to SG-AF-Pipeline-Operators, with membership type Members.</figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Assign Administrator and Operator Roles</h2>\n\n\n\n<ol start=\"3\" class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Assign the pipeline security roles:\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Admins → <strong>Deployment Pipeline Administrator</strong></li>\n\n\n\n<li>Operators → <strong>Deployment Pipeline User</strong></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"runbook-screenshot pipeline-security-screenshot\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;max-width:760px;margin:1.5rem auto\"><a href=\"https://ca-copilotexperiencelab-hwsaws.jollyhill-9f56f37c.centralindia.azurecontainerapps.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/role-assignment-confirmation.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Open full-size screenshot\"><img src=\"https://ca-copilotexperiencelab-hwsaws.jollyhill-9f56f37c.centralindia.azurecontainerapps.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/role-assignment-confirmation.webp\" alt=\"Deployment Pipeline User selected for the operator team before saving.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto\"></a><figcaption>Deployment Pipeline User selected for the operator team before saving.</figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"runbook-screenshot pipeline-security-screenshot\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;max-width:760px;margin:1.5rem auto\"><a href=\"https://ca-copilotexperiencelab-hwsaws.jollyhill-9f56f37c.centralindia.azurecontainerapps.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/teams-created-confirmation.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Open full-size screenshot\"><img src=\"https://ca-copilotexperiencelab-hwsaws.jollyhill-9f56f37c.centralindia.azurecontainerapps.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/teams-created-confirmation.webp\" alt=\"Confirmation that the operator team security roles were updated successfully.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto\"></a><figcaption>Confirmation that the operator team security roles were updated successfully.</figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Share the Pipeline with Read-Only Access</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">After assigning the <strong>Deployment Pipeline User</strong> role, the pipeline record must be shared with the operator team.</p>\n\n\n\n<ol start=\"1\" class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Open the <strong>Deployment Pipeline Configuration</strong> app in the pipeline host environment.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Select <strong>Pipelines</strong> and open <code>AF-PILOT-Standard-Release</code>.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Select <strong>Share → Manage access</strong>.</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"runbook-screenshot pipeline-security-screenshot\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;max-width:760px;margin:1.5rem auto\"><a href=\"https://ca-copilotexperiencelab-hwsaws.jollyhill-9f56f37c.centralindia.azurecontainerapps.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/share-access-01.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Open full-size screenshot\"><img src=\"https://ca-copilotexperiencelab-hwsaws.jollyhill-9f56f37c.centralindia.azurecontainerapps.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/share-access-01.webp\" alt=\"Open AF-PILOT-Standard-Release and select Share &gt; Manage access.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto\"></a><figcaption>Open AF-PILOT-Standard-Release and select Share &gt; Manage access.</figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<ol start=\"4\" class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>In <strong>Add user/team</strong>, open the advanced lookup.</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"runbook-screenshot pipeline-security-screenshot\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;max-width:760px;margin:1.5rem auto\"><a href=\"https://ca-copilotexperiencelab-hwsaws.jollyhill-9f56f37c.centralindia.azurecontainerapps.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/share-access-02.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Open full-size screenshot\"><img src=\"https://ca-copilotexperiencelab-hwsaws.jollyhill-9f56f37c.centralindia.azurecontainerapps.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/share-access-02.webp\" alt=\"Open the advanced lookup from Add user/team.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto\"></a><figcaption>Open the advanced lookup from Add user/team.</figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<ol start=\"5\" class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Select <strong>Teams → All Security Group Teams</strong>.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Search for and select <code>SG-AF-Pipeline-Operators</code>.</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"runbook-screenshot pipeline-security-screenshot\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;max-width:760px;margin:1.5rem auto\"><a href=\"https://ca-copilotexperiencelab-hwsaws.jollyhill-9f56f37c.centralindia.azurecontainerapps.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/share-access-03.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Open full-size screenshot\"><img src=\"https://ca-copilotexperiencelab-hwsaws.jollyhill-9f56f37c.centralindia.azurecontainerapps.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/share-access-03.webp\" alt=\"Choose Teams &gt; All Security Group Teams, select SG-AF-Pipeline-Operators, and select Done.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto\"></a><figcaption>Choose Teams &gt; All Security Group Teams, select SG-AF-Pipeline-Operators, and select Done.</figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<ol start=\"7\" class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Grant <strong>Read</strong> permission only.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Leave Write, Delete, Append, Append To, Assign and Share disabled.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Select <strong>Share</strong> to apply the permission.</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"runbook-screenshot pipeline-security-screenshot\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;max-width:760px;margin:1.5rem auto\"><a href=\"https://ca-copilotexperiencelab-hwsaws.jollyhill-9f56f37c.centralindia.azurecontainerapps.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/share-access-04.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Open full-size screenshot\"><img src=\"https://ca-copilotexperiencelab-hwsaws.jollyhill-9f56f37c.centralindia.azurecontainerapps.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/share-access-04.webp\" alt=\"Grant SG-AF-Pipeline-Operators Read only, then select Share.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto\"></a><figcaption>Grant SG-AF-Pipeline-Operators Read only, then select Share.</figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Read access allows operators to discover and run the shared pipeline without giving them permission to modify its configuration.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Understand Administrator Access</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The <code>SG-AF-Pipeline-Admins</code> team does not need each pipeline record to be shared individually.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What This Establishes for an Agent Factory</h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Centralized pipeline access through Microsoft Entra groups</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Easier onboarding and removal of team members</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Reduced administrative access to the pipeline host</li>\n\n\n\n<li>A scalable foundation for production deployment governance</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Pipeline roles do not automatically grant access to DEV, TEST, or PROD. Environment access and Dataverse security roles must still be managed separately.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Why These Controls Matter</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Agents are deployed as solution components, so an uncontrolled pipeline can introduce unreviewed agent instructions, actions, connectors, knowledge sources, or configuration changes into production.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">When group memberships and effective permissions are validated, these controls help ensure that:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Only approved administrators can change deployment routes.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Only authorized operators can initiate deployments.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Access can be reviewed and audited centrally.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Group-derived access can be removed through Entra membership changes; direct roles, other teams, and separate sharing grants must also be reviewed.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Group-based administration reduces reliance on one person for pipeline access management.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">These configurations establish a group-based access-control foundation for the Agent Factory pipeline. Administrators manage pipeline configuration, while operators receive access to run the shared pipeline without modifying it. This makes access management more repeatable as additional agent projects and release operators are onboarded.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Before treating the setup as validated, test administrator and operator access, review overlapping memberships and direct permissions, and confirm the required source and target environment privileges. PROD approval gating and delegated deployment remain separate configuration steps.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A separately configured and tested PROD approval gate can add independent release review. Delegated deployment determines the deployment identity; it does not by itself establish independent review.</p>\n",
